  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BR Municipal APL Teresina Enhancing Municipal Governance and Quality of Life Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives of the project are to (i) modernize and improve the management capacity of Teresina Municipal Government in the financial, urban, environmental, service-delivery, and economic development fields; and (ii) improve the quality of life of the low-income population of the Lagoas do Norte region of the city.</narrative>
  </description>
